Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.49,0:02:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough the first naked female\Nbody I've seen happen to be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.59,0:02:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too thrilled about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Nyour first naked woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as sad as it is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well get used to seeing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since we'll be sharing a bathroom\Nfor however long we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be careful so I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.79,0:03:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was actually kind of\Nlooking forward to, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.63,0:03:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,getting some one-on-one\Nbath time with this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I saw just how much freaking\Nyounger it is than my actual age.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I kind of look like my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it can't be all that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yunguji, please don't tell me you've\Ngot a thing for childlike blondes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.79,0:03:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truthfully,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.63,0:03:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your appearance is\Nterrifying because of how it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,warps the preferences of\Nanyone who looks at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.79,0:03:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It changes what you're into?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.37,0:03:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As best I can tell,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's some kind of magic embedded in\Nyour appearance that supersedes your looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that it can change my thinking\Nagainst my will is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to change back, and soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit, I'm starting to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could never get\Nunder your skin before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.07,0:03:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now it's like it's almost too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.39,0:03:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's the fact I have the\Nwhole village fawning all over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, the attention is doing\Nwonders for my ego, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can't wait to go back\Nto being a man again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.61,0:04:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, alrighty then. It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you in any way I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you said that I was terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been asking around,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems like no one has even heard of\Nthis demon lord we're supposed to defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They did mention a big town up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we should go there next and see\Nif there's anything we can learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we have plenty of travel\Nfunds, we should plan on leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.96,0:04:36.46,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(272,0)\blur0.7\c&HF78613&\3c&HF78613&\fnJust One\b0\fs120\bord5\fsp5\frz3\1a&HFF&\t(271,272,\1a&H00&)\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)\move(439,290.33,505,289.53)}F{\frz2\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}l{\frz1\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}o{\frz0\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}w{\frz-1\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}i{\frz-2\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}n{\frz-3\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}g
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.96,0:04:36.46,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(272,0)\blur0.7\c&H88F3F6&\3c&HF78613&\fnJust One\b0\fs120\bord0\fsp5\frz3\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)\move(439,290.33,505,289.53)}F{\frz2\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}l{\frz1\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}o{\frz0\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}w{\frz-1\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}i{\frz-2\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}n{\frz-3\t(0,1000,\frz-3)\t(1000,2000,\frz3)}g
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is my hair\Nfluffier and shinier than yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is drying women's hair yet another\Nthing you're freakishly good at?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.57,0:04:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I passed by a salon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you saw it done once and mastered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.57,0:04:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.69,0:04:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened with that fire yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems it rained and that took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.81,0:04:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, if you would just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect me to be calm about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to settle this peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.83,0:05:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I see that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't satisfied with\Njust burning down our forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to make a mockery of\Nour guardian deity as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choose humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.97,0:05:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either bring me the criminals responsible\Nor I will tear this village apart myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:22.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, seeing people angry\Nlike that makes me uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.65,0:05:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like when I'd see the newbies at the office\Ngetting yelled at for whatever reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It always felt like I was\Ngetting yelled at, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.01,0:05:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I understand what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this particular instance, we are\Ndefinitely the people that woman's angry with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, in conclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we did not in fact burn\Ndown your forest and our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killing of your guardian\Ndeity was in self-defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thus making us innocent of all charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.03,0:05:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so aggressive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arrogance of you\Nhumans knows no bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you're the ones responsible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:06:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, however, we wish\Nto negotiate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guardian deity was the\Nprotector of our sacred forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it attacked, then you were\Ntrespassing on its hallowed grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it hadn't attacked us,\NI wouldn't have had to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit digging us into a\Nbigger hole, hole digger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend here's not\Nreally a people person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now apologize to the nice elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop trying to get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that we're\Narguing with a real elf, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intimidating Scowl aside,\Nshe's really pretty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.63,0:06:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The small one's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a human, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.57,0:06:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That translucent skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,golden hair and a\Nwell-proportioned face and I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can see some effort in\Nher appearance however it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.93,0:06:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pales in comparison to the\Nmagnificence of my beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the heck is going on\Nshe's doing it again if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:06:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she could just keep her\Nclothes on she'd be halfway
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,normal I'm sure that\Nyou're wondering how such
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.19,0:07:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An exquisite form could\Neven exist. I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.35,0:07:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's because we elves are\Nfollowers of the goddess of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.11,0:07:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,love and beauty she is\Ngenerous alluring and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,splendid and we are her\Npeople our long ears are clear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.79,0:07:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proof of our connection\Nto her if that's true you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must be just as bad as\Nshe is and those ears are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing like the one she's\Nrocking silent you two
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,admit your crimes and beg\Nfor mercy press your heads
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the ground and sing\Npraises of my wondrous form
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.05,0:07:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we just gotta kneel\Ndown and you'll forgive us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.79,0:07:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look really! Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to humiliate ourselves\Nfor an exhibitionist like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.43,0:07:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we can both agree there\Nwas a better way to phrase that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't apologize for\Nspeaking the truth regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed at how cavalier you\Nare about being half-naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.59,0:07:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Praise your form, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.73,0:08:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in\Nwomen in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now that I'm accustomed to Tatyabana's\Nnew look, you have nothing I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.41,0:08:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finished here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh man, way to see the\Nquiet part out loud, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.83,0:08:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's weird about speaking the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once a man sees my luxurious body,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he should be compelled to bring me\Ngifts and bend to my every whim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the men of this village pay\Ntribute simply to one my favor, and yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.59,0:08:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they do that because\Nyou're scary when you're upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's put it\Nto a vote then, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Popularity and beauty go hand in hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.09,0:08:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear sweet villagers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.85,0:08:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this girl or myself, assemble before\Nthe one you think is most beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.58,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,0)\c&HC65E31&\1a&HFF&\t(274,275,\1a&H00&)\3c&HC65E31&\fscx100\fscy100\frz2\t(25,1750,\frz3)\t(24,1700,\fscx105\fscy105)\fs150\bord1\blur0.7\fnBlueberry Personal Use\pos(761.24,675.69)}C{\frz1.33\t(25,1750,\frz3)}r{\frz0.67\t(25,1750,\frz3)}o{\frz0}w{\frz-0.67\t(25,1750,\frz-3)}d{\frz-1.33\t(25,1750,\frz-3)}e{\frz-2\t(25,1750,\frz-3)}d
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.58,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,0)\c&HDD7443&\3c&HC65E31&\fscx100\fscy100\frz2\t(25,1750,\frz3)\t(24,1700,\fscx105\fscy105)\fs150\bord0\blur0.7\fnBlueberry Personal Use\pos(761.24,675.69)}C{\frz1.33\t(25,1750,\frz3)}r{\frz0.67\t(25,1750,\frz3)}o{\frz0}w{\frz-0.67\t(25,1750,\frz-3)}d{\frz-1.33\t(25,1750,\frz-3)}e{\frz-2\t(25,1750,\frz-3)}d
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I just feel sorry for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's any consolation, elf lady,\NI think you're prettier than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, you really shouldn't\Ntake stuff like this seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.31,0:08:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, you're rubbing\Nsalt in the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Suggest you see this as\Na learning opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe rethink your adherence\Nto your precious deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows it might help with\Nthat personality of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.85,0:09:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't casually suggest\Nshe abandoned her faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.41,0:09:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see so that's what you are your acolytes\Nof some heretical religion aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you brainwash the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.99,0:09:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else could they\Nhave chosen you over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all makes sense now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.99,0:09:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defiling our sacred land, slaughtering\Nour guardian deity, making a fool of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.35,0:09:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to undermine\Nthe majesty of our goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suspected you were someone who couldn't\Nadmit they lost, but this is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.51,0:09:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence your lying tongue, you heretic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,O goddess, in your exalted\Nseat, master of the long ears,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.59,0:09:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, your humble servant, here and\Nnow, offer my beauty in your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beseech thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cleanse away this filth before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:09:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky! Magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By eliminating you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will restore the proper balance of\Nthis place with me as the most beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die for my sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill us\Nover something so petty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't care who else she might hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get her to the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why'd you you need to be mindful\Nof physical contact holding hands
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should be out of the question sorry\Nfor not thinking what we're being
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,attacked your cowardice only serves to\Ndelay the inevitable your slanderous
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.23,0:10:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,affront to our goddesses a crime\Nbeyond measure death is your penance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.31,0:10:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was overzealous and\Nallowed them to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satayna. Ultina.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll begin searching at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really have to treat\Nme like that back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, then you\Nprobably would have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.13,0:11:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Died?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.61,0:11:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always protect you, even\Nif it kills me in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even joke about something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in this together to\Nthe bitter end, Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live or die! You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And believe me, I have\Nno intention of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I never give up without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's your plan\Nfor the scary elf lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lady! What happened? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.33,0:11:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A very symbol of your elvenhood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, my lady, it's not that bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you forget you're fighting a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.95,0:12:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have shown a little restraint!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show no restraint to\Nthose who would do you harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I did not expect a simple stone\Nto be capable of something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.81,0:12:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One teensy little breeze and that\Nwould have been her head for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, now's probably not the\Nbest time to try and talk things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.29,0:12:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should leave before she recovers\Nand tries to kill us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those cretins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They even took our guardian\Ndeity's pelt with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.81,0:12:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having been so soundly\Ndefeated by those wretches,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can no longer return to our settlement.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I will pursue the heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not let them get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will humiliate them as they did our\Ngoddess and take back what they've stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they will suffer the full,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.69,0:13:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unyielding weight of my wrath\Nfor what they did to my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.51,0:13:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may talk a big game, but in the end\Nshe's more petty than she is devout.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She always gets like\Nthis when she's angry.
