Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.37,0:13:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too you know how ironic\Nthat we ended up in the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only so much walking\Na modern name can take!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're a three-day walk from the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.15,0:13:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way! Not happening! All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.47,0:13:58.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After your tantrum, we can set\Nup camp here for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing like a nice hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that a full-course meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the meat is done, it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to find all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The village huntsmen helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked some of them to teach me\Nwhat was forageable in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.63,0:14:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you gathered all these ingredients\Nand cooked them while I was in the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.23,0:14:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had a long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, I figured you'd be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except now I feel bad. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what to contribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's party time now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make the most of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take these outside and\Ndrink them under the stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, man, that's good.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.90,0:14:48.90,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(276,0)\fnAdega Serif\b1\fs90\blur0.65\c&H181A1C&\alpha&H00&\pos(1073.48,52.77)}*Despite appearances, \N{\alpha&HFF&}...{\alpha&H00&}this is a 32-year old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wipe your mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks absolutely delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got a pretty distinct flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, in fact, it\Nreminds me of game meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it you said this was again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.99,0:15:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fed me the Guardian deity, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd already drained its blood, and\NI didn't want it to go to waste.
