Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.79,0:15:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I wasn't fully honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.15,0:15:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you a warm meal\Nto help you recover your energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you needed the protein\Nto get back to full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.03,0:15:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did all this because\NI said I was tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all things aside, this\Nis actually pretty tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, the beer is cold\Nand the air is crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No complaints here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.71,0:15:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a nice night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to taste all the different\Nkinds of booze this world has.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting like we're\Non vacation or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're acting like\Nwe're back at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been all work and no play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.69,0:15:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now relax, or you'll stress\Nyourself bald. Bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.29,0:15:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have earned a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.99,0:15:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been so busy with work and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When's the last time we took it easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.41,0:16:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a different world\Nwith good food and free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.55,0:16:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's watching, so why\Nnot kick back for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hadn't thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been quite a while since\NI allowed myself to take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.31,0:16:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you want to know what the best\Npart of being in a different world is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do what we want.\NStop. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone told me if I get too hot\NI should take off my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I see that you're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.31,0:16:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had a sip of beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.61,0:16:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is true, but of course you've\Nnever imbibed with your new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've lost your tolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That explains why everything's suddenly\Nup and decided to start getting wobbly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the stupid tiny body\Nbeing stupid and tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit babbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you've had enough tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.55,0:16:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can finish it tomorrow. Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.15,0:16:49.27,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(276,0)\fnAdega Serif\b1\fs90\blur0.65\c&H181A1C&\pos(26.28,860.57)\alpha&H00&}*Despite appearances, \N{\alpha&HFF&}...{\alpha&H00&}this is a 32-year old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting our world's\Nrules don't apply here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'll do what I want to!
