Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.27,0:17:23.85,Signs,Track,0,0,0,,{=27}{\frz0\alpha&H00&\an7\blur10\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H0A0A0A&}m 253 757 l 257 397 1071 403 1069 753
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.85,0:17:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the effect of this so-called\Nblessing is utterly useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:35.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.69,0:17:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how or why, but\NI think I'm stuck. Wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.49,0:17:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my blood is starting\Nto rust in my head
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the springy rope\Nstuff is super annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.37,0:17:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Can't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been caught by some\Nstrange sort of plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.51,0:17:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's too much skin exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.61,0:18:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,both by myself?
