Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you please pull up your shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here! Just hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.77,0:18:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These things are really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, here I can see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad that crisis is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like it better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.27,0:18:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seriously going to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this have to\Nhappen to little old me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got drunk and ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is 100 % your mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.25,0:18:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then why didn't you try and stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did, repeatedly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was stupid and I'm sorry, now\Nplease hurry up and save me!
