Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.87,0:18:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that I'm unable to\Nmove because deep in my subconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.11,0:19:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see Tachibana exposed like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That plant is already at the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to be distracted right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.45,0:19:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm charmed, I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time, that slap cured the effect.
