Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.25,0:19:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.17,0:19:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to say something that\Nwill shock me to my very core!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.13,0:19:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:27.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life is so boring, I couldn't\Neven make my grandmother blush.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.35,0:19:30.23,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnFree Pixel\b1\fs11\frz31.41\blur0.5\fax-0.01\c&H7B766C&\pos(1347.67,633)}Charmed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, do it quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.41,0:19:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I take a nap instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.73,0:19:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peppers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to eat them.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.86,0:19:41.87,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnFree Pixel\b1\fs4\frz-21.04\blur0.5\fax0.36\c&H7F7A70&\pos(1365,204)}Charmed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a 32-year-old man and you\Nstill won't eat peppers? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not quite sure where this rage\Ncame from, but it did the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You doing all right over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, you leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.37,0:20:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen here, buddy, you can deflect beams,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're super strong\Nand you're still a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I got turned into a\Ndefenseless little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.55,0:20:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who gets blind drunk off\None measly sip of beer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and bell pepper suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not going to dignify\Nthat with a response.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do all the worst of the\Nworst things happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be reborn as a hot guy and\Nhave loads of cute girls fun all over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My whole life I've been teased\Nfor having a girly name!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my little sister\Nwon't stop calling me Hina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsukasa-Chinkuchi is a\Nsuper cutesy name too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.97,0:20:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one getting picked on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.27,0:20:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why you gave the\Nheroine my name all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry, Tachibana?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may sound selfish, but it\Nhurts me to see you this upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinguuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mother, your spirit. Between the two,\Nwhere do you think a person's gender lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think that whichever\Nyou think is right, is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear this rule is\Ntotally crap! I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:37.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may look young, but you're\Nstill a cranky old drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did this come from?
